        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "(Nasdaq: INOD) (together with its subsidiaries, the “Company”, “Innodata”, “we”, “us” or “our”) is a global data engineering and AI systems services company that supports the development, training, post-training, evaluation, and deployment of advanced artificial intelligence systems.",
        "start_character": 50,
        "end_character": 334
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-020655",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-020655-b0aa4a607daf7468",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-020655",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In the course of providing services, we may develop tools, workflows, annotations, evaluations, or other work product that incorporate our pre-existing intellectual property or general methods and expertise.",
        "start_character": 32304,
        "end_character": 32511
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-020655",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-020655-b0aa4a607daf7468",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-020655",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We believe the timely development and deployment of platform functionality is important to supporting efficient services delivery as well as seizing new market opportunities and promoting product/service differentiation.",
        "start_character": 43429,
        "end_character": 43649
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-020655",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-020655-b0aa4a607daf7468",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-020655",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We encrypt all sensitive information, both at rest and in transit, to the Advanced Encryption Standard (AES) 256 or similar standard, and we employ a range of security features, including industry-leading managed firewalls, intrusion detection and prevention services.",
        "start_character": 18145,
        "end_character": 18413
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-020655",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-020655-b0aa4a607daf7468",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-020655",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We intend to align our business with large, dynamic, and rapidly growing markets related to the development, evaluation, and commercialization of advanced AI systems, as well as the deployment of AI across enterprise and public-sector environments.",
        "start_character": 19177,
        "end_character": 19425
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-020655",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-020655-b0aa4a607daf7468",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-020655",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "In India, the Philippines, and Sri Lanka, we actively support grass-roots environmental conservation initiatives in the communities in which we operate.",
        "start_character": 46239,
        "end_character": 46391
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-020655",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-020655-b0aa4a607daf7468",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-020655",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "In addition, we are selectively developing and expanding strategic partnerships and channel relationships to support customer acquisition and the expansion of existing customer relationships.",
        "start_character": 26396,
        "end_character": 26587
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-020655",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-020655-b0aa4a607daf7468",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-020655",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "These regulatory requirements address, among other things, the collection, processing, storage, security, transfer, and use of data, and may differ materially across jurisdictions in which we operate or support customer programs.",
        "start_character": 36795,
        "end_character": 37024
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-020655",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-020655-b0aa4a607daf7468",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-020655",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Through this work, we developed and refined techniques for generating, curating, and validating human-created data used to train probabilistic, learning-based AI systems, and recognized that data quality and structure were critical determinants of model performance.",
        "start_character": 1539,
        "end_character": 1805
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-020655",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-020655-b0aa4a607daf7468",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-020655",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We also pursue charter customer relationships to co-develop new solutions and platforms, enabling us to align innovation efforts closely with real-world requirements while scaling capabilities across our broader customer base.",
        "start_character": 22005,
        "end_character": 22231
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-020655",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-020655-b0aa4a607daf7468",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-020655",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We apply these insights to inform the design and evolution of our industry-specific AI platforms, integrating new AI techniques into core workflows in ways that reflect where the market is moving.",
        "start_character": 13920,
        "end_character": 14116
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-020655",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-020655-b0aa4a607daf7468",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-020655",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We are investing in capabilities related to agentic trust and safety, including evaluation frameworks designed to assess agent behavior, tool use, and adherence to constraints across multi-step workflows.",
